<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB leaves discount rate unchanged after meeting.</title>
<headline>SNB leaves discount rate unchanged after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank said it left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after a regular weekly meeting of its three-member policy-setting board.</p>
<p>&quot;No change,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>No change was expected in the rate, which was last altered when it was lowered by half a percentage point to 1.00 percent on September 26.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
